  <Docs>
    <summary>Configure the <c>MediaProjection</c> session requested from
            <c>MediaProjectionManager#createScreenCaptureIntent(MediaProjectionConfig)</c>.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Configure the <c>MediaProjection</c> session requested from
            <c>MediaProjectionManager#createScreenCaptureIntent(MediaProjectionConfig)</c>.</para>
      <para>This configuration should be used to provide the user with options for choosing the content to
            be shared with the requesting application.</para>
